; Program 3.16: Factorial n! for any n >= 0, including 0
; Source: Дьяконов, «Справочник по расчётам на микрокалькуляторах», 1985, p.61 (book61.pdf page 62)
; Input: n in X.  Output: n! in X.  С/П again with a new n (the program loops to 00).
;
; Book examples: 0! = 1, 1! = 1, 3! = 6, 10! = 3628800, 20! = 2,432902*10^18
; @input 0
; @expect X=1
; @input 1
; @expect X=1
; @input 3
; @expect X=6
; @input 10
; @expect X=3628800
; @input 20
; @expect X=2.432902e18
;
00: П0 Fx≠0 11 1 ИП0 × FL0 04 С/П
09: БП 00 1 БП 08
